  "description": "Amflow PR combines striking aesthetics with a full-carbon frame, delivering 150N·m torque and 1500W peak output. With a swappable battery for extended rides, unleash your speed, style, and true self.\n\nPotent Power, Quiet Performance\n\nWith 150N·m torque and whisper-quiet 45dBA operation, every ride feels smooth, powerful, and immersive.\n\nQuick Swap, Easy Recharge\n\nWith an 800Wh or 600Wh removable battery , Amflow PR enables easy charging and quick swaps for worry-free long-distance riding.\n\nUltra-Light Carbon Fiber Frame\n\nAt around 2.9kg , it balances low weight with exceptional strength and rigidity, bringing greater stability and composure to every ride.\n\nFlexible Adjustment, Effortless Control\n\nWith up to 40 geometry combinations , it fine-tunes head tube angle, bottom bracket height, and chainstay length to suit different trails and riding styles.\n\nSmoothShift for Fast Gear Changes\n\nIntegrated with the SRAM electronic rear derailleur, the drive system enables the SmoothShift function, allowing you to shift while coasting.\n\nApple Find My Tracking\n\nAmflow PR leverages Apple's vast network to help you track your bike's location and battery level anytime in the Apple Find My app.",
